This repository is licensed in two parts.

  DATA  — everything in circuits/
          Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0
          Full text: LICENSE-DATA.txt

  SCENES — everything in scenes/ (baked 3D circuit models)
          A COMBINATION, and both parts must be satisfied:
            * the original modelled geometry — grandstands, pit buildings,
              barriers, foliage, landmarks — is CC BY-SA 4.0
              (licenses/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt)
            * the map-derived components baked into them — water, coastlines,
              woodland outlines — remain (c) OpenStreetMap contributors
              under ODbL 1.0
          No third-party photograph, sponsor logo, branded texture or
          official architectural model is embedded in any scene.

  CODE  — the viewer (index.html, viewer.js, scene.js, viewer.css), vendor/
          and tools/
          MIT License
          Full text: LICENSE-CODE.txt
          vendor/ is third-party; see licenses/.

The data is ODbL as a PRECAUTION. The circuit outlines may descend from map
data carrying share-alike obligations; the upstream repository labels them MIT
and does not mention OpenStreetMap, while our own asset records attribute the
traces to OSM. We could not establish which is correct, and chose the licence
that meets the obligation if it exists. This is a judgement under uncertainty,
not a finding that the obligation applies. Share-alike is a real restriction
on you, so read PROVENANCE.md before relying on any of it.

Required attribution when redistributing the data:

  Circuit geometry (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0, via
  bacinger/f1-circuits. Elevation from NASA SRTM. Racing lines and corner
  data derived by Raceline.

Third-party notices are in licenses/.
